Package: fiorino
Title: In-Context Tabular Foundation Models (FiorinoNano)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("frank", "hull", email = "frankiethull@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to FiorinoNano tabular foundation models for
    in-context learning on tabular data. `fiorino_classifier()` and
    `fiorino_regressor()` store the training set as an in-context prompt
    (no gradients) and answer queries in one forward pass, via the Python
    `fiorino` package over reticulate. Weights download once from
    Hugging Face (`Nanite-Labs/nanites-fiorino-tabular`).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    reticulate
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
